    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/8/0/80581.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 6,
    "turn_text": "So what I find interesting is that as we are on the cost both these games, and we have a diplomatic boycott, and other countries have done the same thing. So that means essentially that the high ranking officials that you would generally see from a number of countries, including the United States, won't be there to cheer on their teams at these games. How effective do you think that China, what would their response to that be? Does that matter to them?",
