    "turn_idx": 7,
    "turn_text": "Well, just in your run up, I just want to state that, you know, prior to me calling for a boycott and calling for a full boycott, you know, we asked the IOC, the International Olympic Committee on multiple occasions given that two administrations now have labeled what's going on in China as a full-blown genocide. We asked them to move the games. And we saw with the Tokyo games that were moved and delayed because of COVID that certainly can be done. It was only when it became very clear that IOC was just going to continue to turn a blind eye to these mass atrocities that we called for a full boycott. And the reason We did that is because, frankly, the Chinese could care less whether a few officials from the US State Department",
